    {
      "text": "A perspective rendering of the same folio-lifecycle BPMN diagram (lanes now left to right: publication manager, review team and SMEs, validation and QA, editors and authoring agents, work plan, programme manager) with dark beans scattered freely across every lane — the swarm picture, in which agents do not stay in their swimlanes.",
